# The site is the static files at the repo root. The training pipeline, its
# tests and tooling live here too, and none of it is served. Without this file
# Vercel uploads every path, so pipeline/cache (salaries, bios, game logs) would
# be public at hoops.dumbmodel.com/pipeline/...
#
# Root-anchored on purpose. A bare `data/` also matches public/data/ and strips
# files the pages fetch.
/pipeline/
/tests/
/scripts/
/bench/
/docs/PIPELINE.md
/conftest.py
/pyproject.toml
/Makefile
/.pre-commit-config.yaml
/train.sh
/model_registry.json
__pycache__/
*.pyc
